      "difficulty": "3★",
      "text": "<h2>Overview</h2><p>Mega Malamar was one of the original Super Mega Raid bosses debutted during Kalos Tour. It does not serve any PVE value currently. Mega Malamar learns a various set of problematic moves for bug counters. These are peck, psybeam, psywave; all powerful to the typical counters Mega Beedrill or Mega Heracross. Nonetheless with a low attack stat, Mega Heracross can brute force these moves. </p><h4>Est Time to Win: 210.0s - 270.0s</h4><h2>Main Strategy</h2><p>Simply DPS with Mega Heracross, dodging problematic moves like Hyper Beam or Psybeam. You may need to rejoin between 3 to 5 time depending on the boss cadence. It is recommended, although not required to <a href=\"https://soloraidarchive.github.io/solo-raid-mechanics.html#strategy-tick-perfect-cast\" target=\"_blank\">Tick Perfect Cast</a> as Fury Cutter is a very EPS centric move.</p><p>Additional bug options which do not subtract DPS include Genesect, Kartana and Shadow Vikavolt.</p>",
